{"id":17498,"name":"Wayne County","slug":"wayne-county","state":"Ohio","code":"OH","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-tax-sales-states/ohio-tax-deed-and-tax-liens/wayne-county/","lastUpdated":"2025-05-06T02:29:15","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Foreclosure Sale","typicalSaleDate":"Every Wednesday","bidProcedure":"Premium Bid","contact":"Wayne County Sheriff’s Office","extra":[{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Wayne County Justice Center, 201 West North Street, Wooster, Ohio 44691"},{"label":"Deposit Requirements","value":"$2,000 (up to $10,000), $5,000 ($10,001 to $200,000), $10,000 (above $200,000)"},{"label":"Payment Method","value":"Cashier’s Check or Certified Check"},{"label":"Final Payment","value":"After-sale confirmation"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"p8aEEsAL2AZRFokouU5G9q8uPhzWf6BKCU1R4SGQvvhbprmHFVYKjgxCNTx7LyVD0Ocfj9ntT\"><iframe title=\"Best Kept Secret: 40-90% Off Property Auctions - Wayne County - Ohio Tax Lien &amp; Deed Investing\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/y3DiXqkBtnc?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Grab-the-Chance-to-Own-Property-Easily-in-Wayne-County,-Ohio\">Grab the Chance to Own Property in Wayne County, Ohio, at Tax Deed Sales</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Are you looking to buy properties at a great value? Wayne County, <a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-tax-sales-states/ohio-tax-deed-and-tax-liens/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Ohio</mark></a>, offers a unique opportunity through its tax foreclosure sales. These sales provide immediate ownership upon purchase, unlike most tax deed sales. Here&#8217;s everything you need to know about investing in the County tax foreclosures.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Wayne-County-Tax-Foreclosure-Sales\">Tax Foreclosure Sales Process</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The County conducts tax foreclosure sales, not tax lien certificate sales. These sales are held at the Wayne County Justice Center in Wooster, making the process straightforward and reliable. Here are the key details:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Auction Location:</strong> The County Justice Center, 201 West North Street, Wooster, Ohio 44691</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Auction Time:</strong> Every Wednesday at 10:00 A.M.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Deposit Requirements:</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Up to $10,000:</strong> $2,000 deposit</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>$10,001 to $200,000:</strong> $5,000 deposit</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Above $200,000:</strong> $10,000 deposit</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Payment Method:</strong> Only Cashier’s Check or Certified Check payable to the Wayne County Sheriff’s Office</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Final Payment:</strong> Made after the sale’s confirmation​.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Wayne-County-Auction-and-Foreclosure-Information\">Wayne County Auction and Foreclosure Information</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>For more detailed and updated information, you can visit the following links:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://waynecountysheriff.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Sheriff’s Office</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://wayne.sheriffsaleauction.ohio.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Auction Site</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.taxsaleresources.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Tax Sale Information</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details-at-a-Glance\">Important Details at a Glance</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wayne-County-Ohio-Courthouse.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wayne-County-Ohio-Courthouse-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wayne-County-Ohio-Courthouse-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wayne-County-Ohio-Courthouse-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wayne-County-Ohio-Courthouse-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wayne-County-Ohio-Courthouse-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wayne-County-Ohio-Courthouse.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wayne-County-Ohio-Courthouse.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wayne-County-Ohio-Courthouse-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wayne-County-Ohio-Courthouse-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wayne-County-Ohio-Courthouse-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wayne-County-Ohio-Courthouse-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wayne-County-Ohio-Courthouse-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-17501 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Wayne County Ohio Courthouse\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Pro-Tips-for-Attending-Auctions\">Pro Tips for Attending Auctions in Wayne County</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Arrive Early:</strong> To get a good spot and understand the process.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Bring Identification:</strong> A photo ID is required.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Prepare Deposits:</strong> Ensure you have the correct amount in a cashier&#8217;s or certified check.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Do Your Research:</strong> Know the properties you are interested in beforehand.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Frequently-Asked-Questions\">Frequently Asked Questions</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: How do I participate in Wayne County tax foreclosure sales?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: You can participate by attending the auction in person at the County Justice Center or by viewing the sales online.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What happens if I don’t have the deposit at the auction?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: You must have the deposit in a cashier’s or certified check. Without it, the property will be resold to the next highest bidder.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: When is the final payment due?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: The final payment is due after the sale’s confirmation, which ensures a secure transaction.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>By keeping these points in mind and preparing adequately, you can make the most of the property investment opportunities in Wayne County, Ohio. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Ready to dive into Wayne County, Ohio’s tax lien and deed investing opportunities? Start by conducting thorough research and exploring available resources. For personalized guidance, <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">book a consultation</mark></a> with us today!</p>\n<p><em>Sign up or log in to view the full content.</em></p><div id=\"popup-overlay\"></div><div id=\"signup-popup\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\"><h4>Get Instant Free Access To The Training Vault Now</h4><p>Learn how to get 18-36% returns on your investment and buy property for as little as $500 with tax lien and tax deeds.</p><div class=\"video-container\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 20px 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/FkB-M8RaSHo\" allowfullscreen style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560px; height: 315px; border: none; border-radius: 8px;\"></iframe></div><div class=\"button-container\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: ce